<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44831" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπορ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔπορος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ease, facility</i>, of doing a thing, c.
			inf., <i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				100.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναῦς εὐ. ἦν ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.52
				</span></i>
			: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅτε πολλὴ ὑμῖν εὐ. φαίνεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					7.6.37
				</span></i>
			: c. gen. rei, <i>easy means of providing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ βίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					321e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ καθ᾽ ἡμέραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.82
				</span></i>
			; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. ἐν τῇ τέχνῃ, ἐκ τῆς
				τέχνης</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				24.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. τῆς τύχης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.45
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπορίαν τῇ βδελυρίᾳ τῇ
				ἑαυτοῦ τοὺς συμμάχους ποιεῖσθαι</span> to make them
				<i>a means of satisfying</i> his brutal passions, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.107
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ παρ᾽ ἀλλήλων εὐ</span>.
			mutual <i>assistance</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				6.67
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>plenty, abundance</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πενίη</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				101
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					4.8.28
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγαθῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1091b26
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ περὶ τὸν βίον εὐ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				12.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ περὶ τὴν οὐσίαν εὐ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1326b34
			</span></i>: abs., <i>welfare</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.3.7
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπορία</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1279b27
			</span></i>: in pl., <i>advantages</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				15.253
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				5.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπορίαι προσόδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1293a3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρουραίη εὐ</span>. rustic
				<i>wealth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				9.373.6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μιῆς ὄϊος καὶ βοὸς
			εὐ</span>. <i>consisting of</i> one sheep or ox, ib.<i><span class="en">
				149
			</span></i> (Antip.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ Εὐ. θεά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					1111
				</span></i>
			 (Piraeus, <span class="entity">iii A.D.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπορία</span>, <i>solution of doubts</i> or
			<i>difficulties</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				15c
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμηχανία</span>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				9.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ὕστερον εὐ. λύσις τῶν πρότερον
					ἀπορουμένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					995a29
				</span></i>
			; <i>resourcefulness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Off.</u>
				7
			</span></i>.</div>
